sequenceDiagram
    participant App as App<br>[implements GapCentralResponse]
    participant Node as Node<br>[implements GapCentral]

    Note over App, Node: Allowed states: connected.<br>Calling outside connected asserts on the Node.<br>Pre-conditions: prior AuthenticationRequired(isNumericComparison=false)<br>(Passkey Entry method).<br>Must be called within the 30s SMP timeout<br>(Core Spec v6.3, Vol 3, Part H, Section 3.4).

    App->>Node: GapCentral.AuthenticateWithPasskey(485923)

    Note over App: Passkey delivered to the SMP procedure.<br>Result surfaces on the outstanding<br>PairAndBond's PairingResult callback.<br>See "Passkey Authentication" for the full flow.
    Note over App, Node: If the peer disconnects before the App enters the passkey,<br>PairingResult may or may not fire before CurrentState(standby).<br>Reason: SMP is paused waiting on the local user response,<br>so the stack has no canonical cancellation event to raise.<br>Treat CurrentState(standby) as terminal.
